{"slug":"Blackhawk-Rescue-Mission-5-BHRM5-OPERATOR-TOOL-2-Silent-aim-228823","_id":"6aadb4d92bf200d05b70add9","title":"BHRM5 OPERATOR TOOL 2.1 Silent aim","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c7864c","gameId":2916899287,"name":"Blackhawk Rescue Mission 5","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-fc0c2b424652e05d6034fd2b6c7453ee-ac7fdd0cfb34.png","placeId":2916899287},"features":"features\n- Wall ESP — every hostile gets a vis-box on the head plus a live distance tag. Boxes update in real time: green means a clear bullet path, red means cover between you and him. Round-robin visibility pass, no target starvation, no fps hit.\n- Silent Aim — FOV 140 lock that never snaps your camera. Refreshes at 33Hz against live target positions so moving NPCs are tracked in real time. Sticky target logic stops crosshair flicker. Head / Root aim switchable in the UI.\n- Aggressive Wallbang — spawns the round 0.5m from his skull and skips all cover, regardless of wall thickness. Works seamstessly with Silent Aim; spread cone at that distance is ~0, so every shot lands.\n- No Recoil + No Spread — recoil killed at the source (impulse null), spread zeroed per-shot with instant restore. No weapons jam, no camera freeze, reload stays functional.\n- Fullbright — kills shadows and fog, near-daylight visibility.\n- Smart target priority — a visible target always beats a walled one; walled targets only get engaged when wallbang is on. Other NPCs' bodies never count as walls.\n- Self-protection — auto-detects your own third-person body and never locks it. Crosshair eats enemies, not your own skull.\n- Live HUD — active-feature pill, target count, FPS counter.\n- UI — click-drag anywhere, minimize, INSERT to toggle visibility, one-tap UNLOAD restores everything clean.\nwhat's new in v2.3\n- rebuilt spread handling — the old gun-jam on fire is gone\n- recoil now killed via impulse null only — no camera freeze, no stuck reloads\n- better vis-aim sync — ESP color now matches exactly what aim will lock\n- faster, lighter core; rapid-fire and big-mag removed for stability\nusage\nload with your executor in PVE mode. paste, pick a mode, toggle features. INSERT hides the panel.\nPVP tease (save for the next update)\nPVP build is in active development — real-player targeting on the same core. follow for release when it drops.","tags":["bhrm","blackhawk","silentaim","esp","npc"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alhgeman/BHRM5-OPERATOR-TOOLS-2/refs/heads/main/BHRM5%20Tool%202\"))()","owner":{"_id":"687b493dee67f5e7dd2860a6","username":"SIGMARRRR10000","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/687b493dee67f5e7dd2860a6-1790115805975.png","status":"offline","id":"687b493dee67f5e7dd2860a6","leaderboard":{"tag":null},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000}},"verified":false,"keyless":false,"discord":"https://discord.gg/CXdqamrD6","views":2663,"executes":4663,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/rbx-fc0c2b424652e05d6034fd2b6c7453ee-ac7fdd0cfb34.png","likeCount":5,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2026-09-18T22:02:01.945Z","editBy":{"_id":"687b493dee67f5e7dd2860a6","username":"SIGMARRRR10000","status":"offline","id":"687b493dee67f5e7dd2860a6"},"keyLink":"","reviewed":{"name":"QueueSherlock","role":"reviewer","roleLabel":"Paid reviewer","at":"2026-09-19T23:45:50.142Z","profile":"/u/QueueSherlock"},"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6aadb4d92bf200d05b70addb","editBy":{"_id":"687b493dee67f5e7dd2860a6","username":"SIGMARRRR10000","status":"offline","id":"687b493dee67f5e7dd2860a6"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-09-18T22:02:01.951Z"},{"_id":"6aaf1eae117363cee4ce3dfc","editBy":{"_id":"687b493dee67f5e7dd2860a6","username":"SIGMARRRR10000","status":"offline","id":"687b493dee67f5e7dd2860a6"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2026-09-19T23:45:50.130Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"6aadc7f2279c6275f0ee45de","commentBy":{"_